1. SCIENTIFIC RESEARCH & ATLAS DATA ATTRIBUTION
===============================================================================
The factual geographic dataset, rip-current hazard ratings, coastal behavior
classifications, sand characteristics, and accessibility metrics are derived
from the following scientific publication:

  Atlas de Playas de Costa Rica con Énfasis en la Seguridad (2024)
  Principal Investigator & Author: Dra. Isabel Arozarena Llopis
  Institutional Affiliation: Programa RONMAC, Universidad Nacional (UNA) &
                             Instituto Costarricense de Turismo (ICT)
  Official Document Portal: https://www.ict.go.cr/es/servicios-institucionales/atlas-de-playas.html

NOTE: The factual indicator classifications are referenced and synthesized
for public safety, tourist education, and scientific dissemination. The
original Atlas publication, its verbatim chapters, and photographic figures
remain the intellectual property of their authors/institutions and are NOT
licensed under the Apache License 2.0.

